	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.root.title": "Specials",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.root.description": "Unlock a special move for each weapon.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.sword.title": "Blade Mastery",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.sword.description": "Kill 50 mobs with a sword. The server reads rhythm, thrusts and parry to open Lightning Cut, Precise Pierce or Counter Cut. Existing unlocks keep all three variants. Shared cooldown.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.dual.title": "Blade Dance",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.dual.description": "Kill 50 mobs while dual wielding. Left click is the main swing; right click is the combined strike. Alternation, pressure or an opening unlock Cross Cut, Twin Burst or Opening Cut. Missing the combined strike exposes you.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.axe.title": "Supremacy",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.axe.description": "Land 20 heavy attacks. Connecting heavies prepare Sovereign Blow; blocked heavies prepare Guard Ruin. No full stun in PvP. Shared cooldown.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.bow.title": "Precision",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.bow.description": "Hit 10 different mobs with a bow. Charged hits prepare True Shot; igniting a TNT minecart with a flame arrow prepares Perfect Ignition. No extra cart explosion.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.trident.title": "Sea Sovereignty",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.trident.description": "Pull a drowned with a trident. Throws, Loyalty, Riptide and vanilla Channeling open Sovereign Throw, Tide Rush or Thunder Judgment. Shared cooldown.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.shield.title": "Active Guard",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.shield.description": "Block 30 hits with a shield. Real blocks prepare Repulse, timed melee intercepts prepare Shield Shock, and covering a teammate prepares Intervention.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.mace.title": "Chain Mastery",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.mace.description": "Land 10 chain throws. Direct entity hits prepare Return Impact; useful block impacts prepare Repulse. Vanilla smash and Wind Burst stay unchanged.",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.spear.title": "Formation Break",
	"advancements.modifiedpvp.combat.spear.description": "Land 10 perfect Counter Strikes against hostile mobs. One Broken Defense opens Total Reaction (Z), Relentless Rush (charge) or Circular Collapse (jab). Counter Strike and Pressure work before the unlock."
